      "concept": "CHARRED DEAD TREES",
      "width": 48,
      "height": 48,
      "seed": 125201,
      "subject": "Subject: one small dead tree of a volcanic plain, chunky and cute, each image a different one of these: a charred dead tree with a thick trunk and a few bare twisted branches of burnt black wood #2e2628 (light #5a4a48 on the left side), a few thin glowing orange ember cracks #f07a2a in the bark; a burnt tree snag, a broken black trunk with two short stubby branches and orange ember tips; a dead tree with ash-grey bark #6a6266 (shadow #3e383c) and a crooked bare crown; a dead black tree with a few red-orange leaves #e8502a still clinging to it. A short trunk at the bottom. About half of the image wide and nearly the full image tall.",
      "negative": "face, eyes, person, ground, grass, green leaves, flames, smoke, fire"
    }
  ],
